msgstr "BLEX에 작가 계정으로 로그인합니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:33
msgid "Open <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">/settings/developer-api</code>."
msgstr "<code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">/settings/developer-api</code>로 이동합니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:38
msgid "Select both <strong class=\"text-content\">Read posts</strong> and <strong class=\"text-content\">Write posts</strong> to create and publish posts."
msgstr "포스트를 만들고 발행하려면 <strong class=\"text-content\">포스트 읽기</strong>와 <strong class=\"text-content\">포스트 작성</strong> 권한을 모두 선택합니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:42
msgid "Copy the full token shown immediately after creation. It cannot be viewed again."
msgstr "발급 직후 표시되는 전체 토큰을 복사합니다. 이 값은 다시 볼 수 없습니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:49
msgid "2. Verify the token"
msgstr "2. 토큰 확인"

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:55
msgid "3. Create a Markdown draft"
msgstr "3. Markdown 초안 만들기"

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:67
msgid "Keep the <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.id</code> and <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.updated_at</code> values from the response. Replace <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">123</code> in the following examples with the returned <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.id</code>."
msgstr "응답의 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.id</code>와 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.updated_at</code>을 기억하세요. 다음 예시의 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">123</code>은 생성 응답의 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.id</code>로 바꿔 넣으면 됩니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:80
msgid "4. Upload an image"
msgstr "4. 이미지 업로드"

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:85
msgid "Use <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.url</code> from the response as the Markdown image URL."
msgstr "응답의 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">data.url</code>을 Markdown 이미지 주소로 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:92
msgid "5. Update the draft"
msgstr "5. 초안 수정하기"

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:94
msgid "To reduce concurrent edit conflicts, send the <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">updated_at</code> value from a detail or creation response as <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">expected_updated_at</code>."
msgstr "동시 수정 충돌을 줄이려면 상세 조회나 생성 응답의 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">updated_at</code>을 <code class=\"rounded bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-content\">expected_updated_at</code>으로 보냅니다."

#: board/templates/board/developer_api_quickstart.html:109
msgid "6. Publish the draft"
msgstr "6. 초안 발행하기"

